Outputs
- None (populates self.**dict** with attributes matching entries)
**str**(self) → str
Inputs
- self
Outputs
- Indented multiline string of all attributes
**repr**(self) → str
Inputs
- self
Outputs
- “Struct({…})” showing internal attribute dict
